                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Agent: Senior Terraform Developer                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Final Answer:                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  The Terraform project `aws-single-node-compute-stack` has been              \u2502\n\u2502  successfully implemented with the requested modular architecture. All       \u2502\n\u2502  files, including root configurations and module-specific `main.tf`,         \u2502\n\u2502  `variables.tf`, and `outputs.tf` files, have been created.                  \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ### Project Structure                                                       \u2502\n\u2502  ```text                                                                     \u2502\n\u2502  aws-single-node-compute-stack/                                              \u2502\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500\u2500 main.tf                                                                 \u2502\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500\u2500 providers.tf                                                            \u2502\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500\u2500 variables.tf                                                            \u2502\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500\u2500 outputs.tf                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500\u2500 README.md                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500\u2500 modules/                                                                \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 networking/                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 main.tf                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 variables.tf                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 outputs.tf                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 security/                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 main.tf                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 variables.tf                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 outputs.tf                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 compute/                                                            \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 main.tf                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 variables.tf                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502       \u2514\u2500\u2500 outputs.tf                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  All files have been written using the `Write Terraform File` tool as        \u2502\n\u2502  required.                                                                   \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2570\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u